<title>MALAYSIA: Perstima aborts plan to sell tin business.</title>
<headline>Perstima aborts plan to sell tin business.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian tin plate maker Perusahaan Sadur Timah Malaysia Bhd (Perstima) said on Thursday it has temporarily aborted its plans to dispose its tin-plating business.</p>
<p>&quot;All negotiations... has been aborted, and for the time being the company does not intend to dispose of its tin plate business,&quot; said Perstima in a statement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company had said in December that it planned to dispose its tin plate activities under a restructuring scheme.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
